{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51987","headline":"咏史得韩非 · 庾抱","name":"咏史得韩非","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"说难徒有美，孤愤竟无申。\n定是名伤命，非关犯逆鳞。\n（见《十万卷楼丛书》本唐释皎然《诗式》卷三。\n）（按：此诗原有署「庾抱一」。\n同书卷五又收庾抱一《骏马》四句，爲《全唐诗》卷三九庾抱《骢马》之後四句，知庾抱一当即庾抱。\n《骢马》全诗出《文苑英华》卷二○九。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庾抱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51987.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51987","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}